"""TCPP01-M12: USB Type-C port protection for sink applications, QFN-12L 3x3 mm.

Single-chip Type-C port protection from STMicroelectronics:
- 22 V tolerant ESD (IEC 61000-4-2 Level 4, ±8 kV contact / ±15 kV air) on
  CC1, CC2 and VBUS connector lines.
- 22 V short-to-VBUS OVP on CC lines (internal back-to-back FETs from
  CCx_c -> CCx).
- Externally programmable VBUS OVP via an N-MOSFET pass switch driven by
  GATE / monitored via SOURCE and VBUS_CTRL.
- "Dead-battery" management on DB/ for USB-PD compliant attach.
- Open-drain FLT/ for OVP/OTP/UVLO fault reporting.

This package only provides the raw IC component (symbol, footprint, sourcing).
Reference application circuitry (CBIAS cap, VBUS_CTRL divider, dead-battery
network, external N-MOSFET) is left to integrators.

Reference: ST DS12900 Rev 7 (https://www.st.com/resource/en/datasheet/tcpp01-m12.pdf).
"""

# Power
VCC = io(Power(voltage="3.3V"), help="3.3 V supply (pin 12). Tie LOW to fully power down the IC (zero Iq).")
GND = io(Ground(), help="Device ground (pin 2 and exposed pad).")

# Connector-side (USB-C receptacle) pins
CC1C = io(Net, help="Connector-side CC1 (pin 7). Wire directly to USB-C CC1.")
CC2C = io(Net, help="Connector-side CC2 (pin 9). Wire directly to USB-C CC2.")
IN_GD = io(Power(), help="Connector-side VBUS (pin 8). Tie to USB-C VBUS at the connector; voltage range 0–22 V.")

# System-side CC pins (after internal back-to-back OVP FETs)
CC1 = io(Net, help="System-side CC1 (pin 3). Connect to MCU/UCPD CC1.")
CC2 = io(Net, help="System-side CC2 (pin 1). Connect to MCU/UCPD CC2.")

# External VBUS pass-MOSFET driver
SOURCE = io(Net, help="External NMOS source sense (pin 4). System-side VBUS rail.")
GATE = io(Net, help="External NMOS gate drive (pin 5).")
VBUS_CTRL = io(Net, help="VBUS OVP threshold sense (pin 6). Set by external resistor divider from VBUS.")

# Control / status
DB = io(Net, help="Dead-battery network (pin 10). Pull-down resistor enables Rd advertisement at unpowered attach.")
FLT = io(Net, help="Open-drain fault flag (pin 11). Asserted low on OVP/OTP/UVLO.")

Component(
    name="U",
    symbol=Symbol(library="TCPP01-M12.kicad_sym", name="TCPP01-M12"),
    footprint=File("QFN-12-1EP_3x3mm_P0.5mm_EP1.45x1.45mm.kicad_mod"),
    part=Part(mpn="TCPP01-M12", manufacturer="STMicroelectronics"),
    pins={
        "VCC": VCC,
        "GND": GND,
        "EP": GND,
        "CC1_{c}": CC1C,
        "CC2_{c}": CC2C,
        "IN_{GD}": IN_GD,
        "CC1": CC1,
        "CC2": CC2,
        "SOURCE": SOURCE,
        "GATE": GATE,
        "VBUS_{CTRL}": VBUS_CTRL,
        "DB/": DB,
        "FLT/": FLT,
    },
)
